/// species(number, axisOrigin, axisDir, look): the species numbered `number`,
/// one of the species numbers above, whiteOakNumber to lacewoodNumber. Returns
/// material, color. When the number, the stem
/// or the look varies from point to point, use speciesMaterial and
/// speciesColor instead, one for each property: this one then computes both
/// wherever either is asked for.
species(number, @point axisOrigin, @direction(axisOrigin) axisDir, look) {
