/// sapwoodDepth(number): how deep the sapwood of species `number` runs in from
/// the bark, mm: its depth in rings times its ring width.
sapwoodDepth(number) {
  return speciesSapwood(number).w * speciesRings(number).x;
}

/// speciesColor(number, axisOrigin, axisDir, look): the colour of the species
