//
// Aging comes in two stages: the change most woods make over months (the age
// row), and a quicker one some make within weeks (the weeks row), as
// purpleheart deepens from the dull mauve of a fresh cut to eggplant purple
// before it browns. On the age scale, where 0.5 is about six months, the
