// Raw sanded colour `raw` (sRGB) finished: aged by light (`aging`, gains in
// linear light), charred `char` mm deep (see charredColor), stained by `uptake` coats of a stain whose transmission is
// `stainGain` (the stain multiplies the wood's colour in linear light by it,
// raised to the uptake, as an absorbing dye does), wetted by the topcoat as
// far as `wetting` (the clear coat of finish()), and seen through the
// topcoat's tint `coatTint`, linear.
